    "name": "Red Slicer Tomatoes",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Slicer varieties include : Big Beef &amp; Perfect Rogue. Slicer tomatoes are large, meaty tomatoes with a classic, slightly sweet flavor, making them ideal for slicing and using in sandwiches, burgers, and salads. Their firm texture allows for even slices, and they hold their shape well, which is why they are popular for BLTs and other dishes where the tomato needs to stay intact.</span></p>",
